<scheme version="2.0" title="Thyroid Carcinoma (THCA) mRNA-miR network (Limma) and MAPK - filter pathway only" description="Takes the output (nodes and edges) of the `thca-mirna-mrna_limma_pathway.ows` workflow and filters only genes (mRNAs) that are part of the pathway and those miRs that regulate them.">
